  "notes": "Playful 'Palantir for family trips' conceit: GitHub-dark palette (#0d1117/#161b22/#58a6ff), 'UNCLASSIFIED // FAMILY OPS' green classification banner text, 'command center' framing. 2px corners, 1px #30363d borders, no shadows. Blue tracked uppercase eyebrow labels (SHARED COSTS, SELECTED EXPENSE, SPLIT MODE, BRIEFING) above white tracked uppercase section headings. Status semantics by color: amber OPEN, green SETTLED / Mark settled. Identity is chosen via a Working-as switch (Parkers/Jiangs/Riveras) and every record shows created/edited-by attribution. Manual allocation mode (live) shows per-family amount inputs, a running total and an amber 'still unassigned' warning strip."
